{"sourceUrl":"https://automation.gdut.edu.cn/info/1081/10356.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:51.424094+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://automation.gdut.edu.cn/info/1081/10356.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>根据广东工业大学《关于做好</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名推荐工作的通知》及《关于做好</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生复试招收工作的通知》要求，现将我院</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试攻读研究生（以下简称</span><span>“推免生”）的复试招收工作办法通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>招收对象</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>获得推荐免试攻读研究生资格的</span><span>2026</span><span>年全国高校应届本科毕业生，及其他符合免试攻读硕士研究生资格条件（如在部队荣立二等功及以上等）的人员。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、招收基本条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>、拥护党的基本路线，政治思想品德好，遵纪守法，诚实守信，学风端正，有较强的学习能力，未曾受过学校行政处分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>、身心健康，有足够的精力和能力完成研究生学业。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>已获得本科所读高校的推免生资格</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>或其他符合免初试攻读硕士研究生资格条件。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、招收专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>、</span></span><strong><span><span>学术学位硕士研究生招生专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>081100控制科学与工程、080800电气工程</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>2、专业学位硕士研究生招生专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>085801电气工程、085406控制工程、085410人工智能</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>3、学术学位博士研究生（直博生）招生专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>081100控制科学与工程</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、复试招收工作安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span><span>、报名时间：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>）预报名时间：</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>18</span><span><span>日（星期四）晚上</span></span><span>24:00</span><span><span>截止；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>预报名方式：申请免试攻读我校</span></span><span>2026</span><span><span>年研究生均需在广东工业大学研究生（含直博生）预推免报名系统（网址：</span></span><span>https://ehall.gdut.edu.cn/gsapp/sys/yjsbmxsd/entrance.do</span><span><span>）进行网上报名（含本校推免生）（具体操作指引请见附件</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）。申请人填写《广东工业大学</span></span><span>2026</span><span><span>年招收推荐免试攻读研究生申请表》（见附件</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>），纸质版于复试时提交。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>）网上正式报名时间：</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>22</span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>网址：</span></span><span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm（简称“推免服务系统”）</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>2</span><span>、计划复试时间（含预复试时间）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>　　</span><span><span>第一批：</span></span><strong><span><span>2025</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>19</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日（星期</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）上午</span><span>9:00开始（初定）</span></span></strong><span><span>，其余</span></span><span><span>批次：</span></span><span><span>根据报名情况分批组织，由学院通知学生。</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>3、复试地点：</span></span></strong><span><span>综合楼</span><span>21</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>、</span><span>212</span><span>室</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4、</span></span><strong><span>复试方式：</span></strong><span><span>线下为主。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考生因个人原因需线上复试的，需在</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日上午</span><span>10</span><span>点前将申请书</span></span><span><span>扫描件发送至邮箱</span></span><a href=\"https://automation.gdut.edu.cn/info/1081/10356.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>soagrad@gdut.edu.cn</span></span></a><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>经学院批准，方可进行线上复试。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>5</span>、复试</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>考核安排（全程录像、录音）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>面试流程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>　　第一阶段：</span></span></strong><span><span>自我介绍</span></span></p>\n<p><span>　　</span><span><span>汇报本科阶段课程学习、科研等情况，以及本学科（专业）以外的学习、科研、社会实践（学生工作、社团活动、志愿服务等）或实际工作表现等，应以课程学习和科研情况为汇报重点。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>　　第二阶段：</span></span></strong><span><span>外语能力测试（满分</span><span>20</span><span>分）</span></span></p>\n<p><span>　</span><span><span>　外语能力测试重点考查考生的外语口语、听力及专业外语等水平。考核方式以口试为主。考生须根据面试小组专家的提问用英语现场作答，复试小组专家根据考生表现给出得分。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>　　第三阶段：</span></span></strong><span><span>专业知识考核（满分</span><span>40</span><span>分）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学术学位类重点考察考生的专业素养、创新能力、科研能力等；专业学位类重点考查考生综合素质、运用基础理论和专业知识分析解决实际问题的能力及职业发展潜力等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试专家根据考生综合表现给出得分。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>第四阶段：</span></span></strong><span><span>综合素质和能力考核（满分</span><span>40</span><span>分）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>作答的考核内容包括运用所学知识分析、解决问题的能力，对本学科发展动态的了解和在本专业领域发展的潜力。综合材料研判是通过考生大学学习成绩、科研成果、专家推荐信等补充材料的查阅和询问，加强对考生既往学业、一贯表现、科研能力、思想政治素质与品德、心理健康及其它综合素质等情况的全面考察。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试专家根据考生汇报情况进行提问，考生进行口头作答，复试专家根据考生既往和</span></span><span><span>现场</span></span><span><span>表现情况给出得分。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>请考生面试时带上</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试情况登记表、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>个人简历、本科阶段成绩单及参加竞赛的证书复印件</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>等</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>录取原则与录取程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）成绩计算方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>复试考核小组成员根据学生的表现，给出各项成绩。学生所得的复试成绩为该考核小组成员所给成绩的平均值（满分</span><span>100</span><span>分）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>计算方法：复试成绩</span><span>=</span><span>专业知识</span><span>+</span><span>外语</span><span>+</span><span>综合素质；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试成绩低于</span><span>60</span><span>分的，视为复试不合格，不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）复试成绩公示</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院将在复试结束后于学院网页公示复试成绩。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（三）录取原则</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>存在以下情况之一的考生不予录取：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>思想品德考核不合格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>未参加复试或复试成绩不合格（低于</span><span>60</span><span>分）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>报考资格不符合规定；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>提供虚假信息；</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六、体检：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>所有拟录取推免生均须在二级甲等及以上公立医院进行体检，于</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>10</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日以前将体检报告寄送至广州市番禺区大学城外环西路</span><span>100</span><span>号广东工业大学综合楼</span><span>205</span><span>许老师（自送或顺丰寄送）。新生入学后将进行体检复查，若有弄虚作假，将取消入学资格。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"5e13a687787fe823ebc5815ee97cfd300838c82348bea489abe300f887618637","textLength":1848,"sourceSha256":"a4382e41f4709f7d8b6f44fbb5e5b4a215c831f706c6fc8862c555e2ba3fb157","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"广东工业大学2026年接收推免生预报名操作指引.docx","url":"https://automation.gdut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1834785635&wbfileid=4654713185A57BA636344B602081586D"},{"name":"广东工业大学2026年招收推荐免试攻读研究生申请表.doc","url":"https://automation.gdut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1834785635&wbfileid=964E7E3A848740B7C0CB10DDCCF8A1EE"},{"name":"广东工业大学2026年招收推免生复试登记表.doc","url":"https://automation.gdut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1834785635&wbfileid=51CB55A2C2E3668D30B8CEAEFC19071C"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-09f940694e7573cb2ebb","title":"2025年广东工业大学自动化学院2026年推荐免试攻读研究生的复试招收工作办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:51.424094+00:00"}
